{"ID":"20240830165759-9cyzdb2","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240830165759-9cyzdb2","title":"山楂叶","type":"doc","updated":"20240830165948"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240830165812-o4nar8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165812-o4nar8c","updated":"20240830165812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、河北、山西、山东等地。\n【性状】\t奇数羽状复叶多不完整，叶柄及叶轴较粗，淡黄色棕色。小叶片多皱缩破碎，完整者宽披针形，不等边，略呈镰状弯曲。长411cm，宽24cm，上表面灰绿色，下表面黄绿色，边缘有重锯齿，薄革质。气微清香，味淡。\n【性味】\t酸，平。\n【功效】\t止痒，敛疮，降血压。主漆疮，溃疡不敛，高血压病。"}]},{"ID":"20240830165812-6qry11d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165812-6qry11d","updated":"20240830165812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206115345-zigqsi0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830165828-omtfzqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830165828-omtfzqa","updated":"20240830165828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 654px;","style":"width: 644px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山楂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山楂-20240712145811-d837czt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 644px;\" parent-style=\"width: 654px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 554px;","style":"width: 544px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山楂 (19)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山楂 19-20240717185713-l830zaa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCl